cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or review Aeye, cite the exact repository commit and the retained
  experiment artifact digests on which your statement depends.
title: "Aeye: Falsifiable Inference Receipts"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wahnich
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: "https://github.com/manfromnowhere143/aeye"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research system for composing and appraising separate claims about
  computational work, committed model execution, arithmetic semantics, and
  independently authorized demand.
keywords:
  - verifiable inference
  - proof of useful work
  - evidence composition
  - reproducible research
  - cryptographic protocols
